    "1 (8 ounce) package fideo pasta",
    "1.5 cups water, divided",
    "1 (8 ounce) can tomato sauce, divided",
    "1 tablespoon chili powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic salt"
